  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Religious minorities in Kenya: Overcoming divides, respecting rights</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Increased religious and constitutional literacy on the respect for rights, adult- and children-educational material
Improved inter-faith working relationships through workshops and coaching
Enhanced awareness on the common ground between faiths and constitutional rights through a communication strategy</narrative>
  </description>
